# Conformance probe pack for the field option `implicit` (spec 0.56) on
# `protobuf`, with two keys on one path. Public. No kinds. Added because
# conformance-implicit binds each path to one key: here the first line on
# path 1 is implicit and the second is not, so a held 0 on the first line,
# left out by `implicit`, still holds the place for ruling 16 of 0.5 and the
# second line's value is not written.
format  conformance-implicit-056-1
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    protobuf
field   probe.n  1  pvarint  implicit
field   probe.x  1  pvarint
